      "status": "completed",
      "finalText": "I booked the demo for Monday, 9 Nov, 09:00–09:45 UTC. Ben Ortiz is added as a guest, and Mei's confirmation email was delivered.\n\n- **Appointment:** \"Product Demo – Mei Rossi\" (apt_035), on the Product Demo calendar (cal_002). Priya Shah (usr_003) is hosting and Mei Rossi (con_044) is the contact. It's 45 minutes, the calendar's standard length. This was Priya's earliest open slot that day.\n- **Guest:** Ben Ortiz, ben.ortiz@rossidesign.co (att_002).\n- **Email:** msg_130 went to mei.rossi40@example.com. It gives the time and says Ben has been added. My first try was rejected over a formatting error, and the retry went through.\n\n**Worth checking:** Our system treats working hours as UTC. Priya's profile and the calendar are both set to New York time, so 09:00 UTC is 4:00 AM there. If her hours are really meant to follow New York time, that's too early. In that case I can move the meeting to a later time and send Mei a corrected email.",
